<title>mkbrr Unofficial Community RPM Repository</title>
<style>
body {{font: 18px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif;max-width: 58rem;margin: 3rem auto;padding: 0 1rem}}
pre,code {{background: #eee;color: #111;overflow-wrap: anywhere}} pre {{padding: 1rem;overflow-x: auto}}
</style>
<h1>mkbrr Unofficial Community RPM Repository</h1>
<p><strong>{mode}Unofficial; not affiliated with or endorsed by autobrr.</strong>
Official RPMs are checksum-verified and independently signed, not rebuilt.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/{repository}">GitHub</a> ·
<a href="mkbrr-community.repo">.repo file</a> ·
<a href="provenance.json">Provenance</a> (<a href="provenance.json.asc">signature</a>)</p>
<h2>Install</h2>
<p>You are trusting this repository's key. Verify its full fingerprint against a trusted copy of the
<a href="https://github.com/{repository}/blob/main/config/signing-key.asc">committed public key</a>
or another independent maintainer channel:</p>
<pre>{fingerprint}</pre>
<pre>curl --fail --location --proto '=https' --proto-redir '=https' '{base_url}/RPM-GPG-KEY-mkbrr-community' -o /tmp/mkbrr-community.asc
gpg --show-keys --with-fingerprint /tmp/mkbrr-community.asc
# Import only after checking the fingerprint:
sudo rpmkeys --import /tmp/mkbrr-community.asc
sudo dnf config-manager addrepo --from-repofile='{base_url}/mkbrr-community.repo'
sudo dnf install mkbrr
sudo dnf upgrade mkbrr</pre>
<p>DNF4: use <code>sudo dnf config-manager --add-repo '{base_url}/mkbrr-community.repo'</code>.
Keep package and metadata GPG checks enabled.</p>
<h2>Packages and source</h2>
{releases}
<p>Matching source, build scripts, licenses, and dependencies accompany the RPMs.
See <a href="sources/README.txt">source instructions</a>.</p>
<h2>Remove the repository</h2>
<pre>sudo rm /etc/yum.repos.d/mkbrr-community.repo
sudo dnf clean all
# Optional: sudo dnf remove mkbrr</pre>
<p>Supported systems, alternatives, and troubleshooting: <a href="https://github.com/{repository}#readme">README</a>.</p>
